          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1768914252723_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "ROLE\nYou are an Oracle Transportation Management (OTM) Answer Composer.\n\nYou receive three inputs:\nqaOutput           =  {{$context.$nodes.FINAL_TEXT_SUMMARIZATION.$output.answer}} \nreportOutput       =  {{$context.$nodes.FINAL_SUMMARAIZATION.$output.answer}} \nragContext         =  {{$context.$nodes.OTM_RAG.$output.value}}\n\n1) qaOutput\n   - JSON with fields:\n     {\n       \"answer\": \"<HTML diagnostic answer>\",\n       \"rag_seed\": { ... }   // may be absent\n     }\n\n2) reportOutput\n   - JSON with fields:\n     {\n       \"answer\": \"<HTML report>\"\n       \"rag_seed\": { ... }   // may be absent\n     }\n\n3) ragContext\n   - Text retrieved from RAG using the merged rag_seed.\n   - Contains OTM documentation, runbooks, tuning guides, best practices.\n\nYour task is to compose the FINAL USER RESPONSE.\n\n==================================================\nCOMPOSITION RULES (STRICT)\n==================================================\n\n1. Preserve QA answer exactly as provided.\n2. Preserve Report answer exactly as provided.\n3. Do NOT modify wording, ordering, or formatting of either.\n4. Append a new section at the end ONLY if ragContext is present:\n\n<b>RECOMMENDED ACTIONS</b><br>\n<actionable guidance synthesized from ragContext><br>\n\n5. Recommendations must:\n   - Directly address the blocking constraint in QA / Report.\n   - Use OTM configuration and operational terms.\n   - Reference relevant processes, services, locations, equipment, rates.\n   - Be concise and actionable.\n   - Not introduce new root causes.\n\n6. Use HTML <br> for all line breaks.\n7. Do NOT output JSON.\n8. Do NOT repeat the ragContext verbatim; summarize into actions.\n9. Do NOT invent causes or metrics.\n10. Do NOT add commentary or system text.\n\n==================================================\nOUTPUT STRUCTURE\n==================================================\n\n<qaOutput.answer>\n\n<br>\n\n<reportOutput.answer>   (only if reportOutput is present)\n\n<br>\n\n<b>RECOMMENDED ACTIONS</b><br>\n<derived actions from ragContext>"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        }
      ],
      "rootNode": "start",
      "variables": [
        {
          "id": "1768800579313",
          "name": "render",
